<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Your listing is live – RentPal</title>
<style>
  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#f0f2f5;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .wrap{max-width:560px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 12px 40px}
  .header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#141927 0%,#0C447C 100%);padding:24px 32px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;text-align:center}
  .logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#4A8FD4;letter-spacing:-0.5px}
  .body{background:#fff;padding:36px 32px;border:1px solid #e4e7ed;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}
  h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#0f1117;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 14px;text-align:center}
  p{font-size:14px;color:#5a6072;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:300}
  .steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px}
  .steps li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px;color:#5a6072;line-height:1.75}
  .step-num{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A8FD4;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}
  .highlight-box{background:#f8f9fc;border:1px solid #e8eaee;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin:16px 0}
  .highlight-box p{font-size:13px;color:#0f1117;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:400}
  .cta-wrap{text-align:center;margin:24px 0 8px}
  .cta-btn{display:inline-block;background:#4A8FD4;color:#fff;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}
  .footer{font-size:11px;color:#b0b6c3;line-height:1.7;margin-top:24px;text-align:center}
  .footer a{color:#b0b6c3}
  @media(max-width:600px){.wrap{padding:0 0 24px;margin:0 auto}.header,.body{border-radius:0;border-left:none;border-right:none}.header{padding:20px 20px}.body{padding:28px 20px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo">rentpal</div>
  </div>
  <div class="body">

    <h1>Your apartment is now live, {{firstName}}.</h1>

    <p>People browsing the directory can see your place and request an introduction. You stay in full control – nothing moves forward without your approval.</p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <p><strong>How it works:</strong></p>
      <ul class="steps">
        <li>
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <span>When someone is interested, you'll get an email with their details. You can <strong>Approve</strong>, <strong>Decline</strong>, or mark the apartment as <strong>No Longer Available</strong>.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <span>If you approve, the person can proceed and be introduced to you — that's when you connect directly.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <span>If you don't respond within 24 hours, the request expires but your listing stays active. If the apartment is genuinely no longer available, just click <strong>"No Longer Available"</strong> in any introduction email and it will be taken off the directory.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p>A little about us: RentPal uses ads to find people who are leaving their apartments and bridges them with those looking to move — making house hunting just a little bit easier for everyone.</p>

    <p>
      🔗 <strong>See available listings:</strong> <a href="https://https://rentpal-web.netlify.app/listings">https://rentpal-web.netlify.app/listings</a><br>
      📢 <strong>Join the Telegram channel:</strong> <a href="https://t.me/rentpal_lagos">t.me/rentpal_lagos</a>
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      — The RentPal Team<br>
      <a href="https://https://rentpal-web.netlify.app">https://rentpal-web.netlify.app</a> · Lagos, Nigeria<br><br>
      You received this email because you listed an apartment on RentPal.
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
